WEBVTT

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:09.026
Choose Sponsors in the side menu.

00:00:09.276 --> 00:00:12.269
Click Demo Bakery (test).

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:16.150
Click Edit.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.484
Tick Home page banner.

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:22.459
Tick After the video.

00:00:22.709 --> 00:00:25.984
Click Save creative.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:30.364
Type "10102026" in the Ends on box.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:35.126
Click Save sponsor.

00:00:35.376 --> 00:00:39.977
Click Approve to run.

00:00:40.227 --> 00:00:44.629
Check that Live shows
beside the sponsor name.
